@tongyx361 Thanks, addressed in b5a5178.
1. Added an explicit `merges_context_messages` class flag (True on `ToolAgentLoop`, inherited by subclasses). The worker now runs the check only when a loop the run can dispatch to declares it: the default loop, loops from `agent_loop_config_path`, and the tool agent when tools or `multi_turn.enable` are set. A custom single-turn loop is no longer checked.
2. Added a parameterized gating test (single-turn, multi-turn, custom loops, disable mode) and a plain multi-turn conversation rendered without tool schemas.

